{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Mission Whilkas</strong>, you take control of a brave cat equipped with a jetpack, on a mission to retrieve the legendary Whilkas cat food recipe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of a single, but challenging level that will test your platforming skills! Use agility and clever thinking to reach your goal and complete the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Note:</strong> The game is short and can be completed in under two hours. If you finish the mission faster, Steam\u2019s standard refund policy applies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute cat with a jetpack \ud83d\udc31\ud83d\ude80</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One level packed with tough platforming challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, but engaging mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging, fair, and fun gameplay</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Mission accomplished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4137970/50819259ed881643ca88db942e8b4f84d6988225.jpg"},{"name":"Death is only the Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4137970/265670e4a1d06c22a603ad3227c56cfd35b8b83d.jpg"},{"name":"My Fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4137970/54e7c5487f874143a163d8359c2b767c140986ed.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4137970?t=1768069235","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4137970?t=1768069235","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137970/bea94742e1af3b4c4767362fd2c393069285f478/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768069235","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s